  {"id":"gesundantwort","type":"function","z":"beschaffung","name":"Lokale Laufzeit antwortet","func":"msg.payload={zustand:'bereit',produkt:'Node-RED',umfang:'lokale Lernvariante'};\nreturn msg;","outputs":1,"x":430,"y":360,"wires":[["antwortwahl"]]},
  {"id":"fehlerfangen","type":"catch","z":"beschaffung","name":"Fachfehler auffangen","scope":["vorbereiten","exportieren","sichern","standlesen"],"uncaught":false,"x":150,"y":440,"wires":[["fehlermeldung"]]},
  {"id":"fehlermeldung","type":"function","z":"beschaffung","name":"Fehler nachvollziehbar melden","func":"msg.statusCode = msg.error.source.id === 'vorbereiten' ? 400 : 500;\nmsg.payload={fehler:msg.error.message};\ndelete msg.error;\nreturn msg;","outputs":1,"x":450,"y":440,"wires":[["ausgabe","antwortwahl"]]},
